OL,3,ADolly Parton's niece wants to learn
OL,4,AWelsh after singing with Bronwen Lewis
OL,5,
OL,6,FSince the songs release, Star has said
OL,7,Fshe would like to "roam every inch of
OL,8,FWales" and perhaps visit the Eisteddfod
OL,9,Fone day, as she enjoys learning more
OL,10,Fabout Wales and the Welsh language.
